            },
            "message": "feat: rescue disabled native tool calls with in-session correction\n\nA model that fires one of OpenCode's disabled native tools previously\nkilled the whole turn with the 'disabled native tool' error. The turn\nnow retries inside the same OpenCode session (--session) with a\ncorrective prompt restating the <pi_tool_call> marker contract, up to\nOPENCODE_PI_TOOL_RESCUES attempts (default 2; 0 restores fail-fast).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
